    <div id="riicol1">
      <h1>find success</h1>
      <p>Growing your business  requires a lot of exploration, plenty of imagination and a serious commitment to success. The possibilities can be daunting, especially for small business owners or busy CEOs...</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Could your web site be better?</li>
        <li>Could you benefit from better search engine exposure?</li>
        <li>Would an interactive demo CD suit your business needs?</li>
        <li>How do you increase online sales?</li>
        <li>Is there a better way to manage your customers?</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Rahvalor Interactive can help  answer those questions. With a specialty in multimedia and web site design and development, we're equipped to help you improve management, streamline everyday tasks and make the web and technology work for your business.</p>
      <p>We begin by consulting with you to plan, set budget and outline goals for the short and long term success of your organization. We follow through by helping you implement those plans cost-effectively and productively.</p>
      <p>Our goal is to help you meet the challenges of doing business in an online environment and to support your evolving business needs.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="riicol2">
      <h1>make it work </h1>
      <div class="fixbgcolor">
        <p>To help you use the web and technology  we can...</p>
        <ul>
          <li> Design and develop your web site, content management system, eCommerce site or Intranet site </li>
          <li> Develop more effective ways for you to manage  customers, inventory or other data with custom  software </li>
          <li> Design and develop multimedia  presentations through custom graphics, animations and voice </li>
          <li> Write and design your online newsletter, web site or blog </li>
          <li> Build an internet presence through search engine analysis, optimization and paid advertising </li>
        </ul>
        <p><a href="contact.asp">Contact Us</a> to find out how we can help you  take advantage of the many multimedia and technology options.</p>
        <h1>latest blogs</h1>
        <p><strong>Why do you need a web site?</strong> </p>
        <p>Ask yourself these three questions to help define your business goals. <a href="http://blog.rahvalor.com/rahvalor/2006/01/why_do_you_need.html">Read blog entry.</a> </p>
        <p><strong>Why do you need a Search Engine Marketing program?</strong> </p>
        <p>Debunking the "build it and they will come" myth. (Coming soon...)</p>
      </div>
